IL_023c: ldstr "RecyclingRate"
IL_0241: ldc.r4 0.5
IL_0246: ldstr "Rate at which the resources are recycled. Value must be between 0 and 1.
The mod always rolls *down*, so if you were supposed to get 2.5 items, you would only receive 2. If the recycling rate is 0.5 (50%), the player will receive half of the resources they would usually need to craft the item, assuming a single item in a stack and the item is of quality level 1. If the item is of higher quality, the resulting yield would be higher as well."
